  "summary": "Born in Ulm in 1879, Einstein worked as a technical expert at the Swiss patent office in Bern from 1902 to 1909 and wrote papers in 1905 that included the special theory of relativity. He later held posts in Prague, Zurich and Berlin, moved to Princeton in 1933, and died there in 1955.",
